# https://www.w3schools.com/python/

These exericises were created based on the W3schools Python tutorials. I have primarily used the above mentioned website to learn Python programming
initially and used the "PyCharm Community Edition" application to code them. The order of presented coding folders are in the same order I followed 
the website to learn the given concepts. I have added extra comments and details for clarity and better understanding. So install a Python app you want and 
download the codes to your machine and follow along for fastest way to learn python.

Please follow along on the order of folders given below.
- Introduction to Python
- File Handling
- Python Modules
          - Numpy Tutorial
                - BASIC
                - RANDOM
                - ufunc
          - Pandas Tutorial
                - BASIC
                - CLEARNING DATA
                - ADVANCED
          - SciPy Tutorial
          - Django Tutorial
                - Django Project
                - Django Template
                - Add Static Files
                - Django QuerySets
                - Django Reference
 - Matplotlib
 - MACHINE LEARNING
 - PYTHON REFERENCE
 - MODULEE REFERENCE
            - Random Module
            - Requests Module
            - Statistics Module
            - Math Module
            - cMath Module
  








